    "updated_at": "2022-06-24T04:45:43Z",
    "body": "CSS [`mask-position`](https://drafts.fxtf.org/css-masking/#the-mask-position)\r\n\r\n[`-webkit-mask-position`](https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#propdef--webkit-mask-position) is defined in the list of aliases.\r\n\r\nSome tests:\r\n\r\n\r\n| test | WebKit | Gecko | Blink |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `document.body.style.webkitMaskPositionX` | \"\" | \"\" | \"\" | \r\n| `document.body.style.webkitMaskPositionX = \"left\"` | \"left\" | \"left\" | \"left\" |\r\n| `document.body.style.webkitMaskPositionX` | \"left\" | \"left\" | \"0%\" |\r\n| `document.body.style.maskPosition` | \"\" | \"\" | undefined |\r\n| `document.body.style.maskPosition = \"100% 100%\"` | \"100% 100%\" | \"100% 100%\" | \"100% 100%\" |\r\n| `document.body.style.maskPosition` | \"100% 100%\" | \"100% 100%\" | \"100% 100%\" |\r\n| `document.body.style.webkitMaskPositionX` | \"100%\" | \"100%\" | \"0%\" |\r\n\r\n\r\noopsie.\r\n\r\n`maskPositionX` and `maskPositionY` are not defined obviously.\r\n\r\nAnother sequence of tests.\r\n\r\n| test | WebKit | Gecko | Blink |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `document.body.style.maskPosition` | \"\" | \"\" | undefined |\r\n| `document.body.style.webkitMaskPositionX = \"left\"` | \"left\" | \"left\" | \"left\" |\r\n| `document.body.style.maskPosition` | \"\" | \"\" | undefined |\r\n| `document.body.style.webkitMaskPositionY = \"100%\"` | \"100%\" | \"100%\" | \"100%\" |\r\n| `document.body.style.maskPosition` | \"left 100%\" | \"left 100%\" | undefined |\r\n| `document.body.style.webkitMaskPosition` | \"left 100%\" | \"left 100%\" | \"0% 100%\" |\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
